<p>The <strong class="selflink">combat_h</strong> include file holds the combat resolution logic for the tactic game.
</p><p>Item specific functions are included from <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Items%20h" title="Items h (page does not exist)">items_h</a>. Damage specific functions (such as attack damage calculations and resists) are included from <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Combat%20damage%20h" title="Combat damage h (page does not exist)">combat_damage_h</a>
</p><p>Be aware that this is a core game resource - any change to this file has the potential to wreck the combat system so handle with care.
</p>
